発者にも理解が求められる多様なセキュリティ機構」について、一つひとつ丁寧に整理して解説するものです。 攻撃者とWebブラウザ開発者たちとのせめぎ合いの歴史から、Webセキュリティについての理解を深める一冊です。","image_url":"http://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1634/7169/products/6268848537769-1_1024x1024.png?v=1609803843","blocks":null,"service_name":"技術書出版と販売のラムダノート","service_icon":"http://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1634/7169/files/logo_32x32.png?v=1487230649","from_url":"https://www.lambdanote.com/products/wbs","original_url":"https://www.lambdanote.com/products/wbs"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CEwA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"debf8b2c-4c5a-41bc-a475-3181c06843ff","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"Webセキュリティ結構あやふやだからちゃんと勉強せねば","ts":"1617949227.478400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PAUEX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7722ab9e-2e62-4af7-9d5a-7c0dfd4e867b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Firebase、不安定だとは聞いたんだけどどうするかな\n迷う","ts":"1617928640.476800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tYp="}]},{"client_msg_id":"c95cf1e5-61df-4144-85c7-0cba5daf0a77","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"おーすごい","ts":"1617928630.476500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xG5Nd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c787fb7f-b341-4f70-9866-1a1884d84475","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"一億総活躍社会ならぬ一億総Firebase社会","ts":"1617894616.476000","edited":{"user":"UNJ2DANJC","ts":"1617894627.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n10OB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05decb50-9b0e-4f8a-804a-117fafbbd4ce","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"匿名は100 milionで匿名じゃないのはUnlimitedですね \u003chttps://firebase.google.com/docs/auth/limits\u003e","ts":"1617894530.47510